      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0009:0003",
      "source": "**parameter 3**: The number of elements in the arrays.",
      "ko": "**매개변수 3**: 배열 내 요소 개수입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "51dce05009917e8c2a33b88cc0cd7c4fc85330dc1ce62a74b93bce904527addb",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0010:0001",
      "source": "If `x` is `+/-0`, the result preserves the signed zero.",
      "ko": "`x`가 `+/-0`이면 결과가 부호 있는 0을 유지합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "085759b7cea3eead013414eebb982d670e96d2a3f85ffeb6782c79125bed6261",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:parameters:0011:0001",
      "source": "If `x` is `+/-inf`, the result is `+inf`.",
